     "end": 822,
     "note": "Luzi shows **two ways**: 1:09 the official way (radio and TV) and 3:32 the everyday way (conversation). Beginners can always use the first one.\n\nEveryday way by minutes: 7:08 (1–20) · 8:29 (21–29) · 9:30 (31–39) · 10:25 (40–59) · 11:25 bonus *kurz vor / nach, etwa* · 12:23 bonus *um* + time."
